ame.\nHere are some of the features included in the script so you can understand what it does and what it can be used for. This project is not just about making a script — it’s about creating useful tools.\nFeatures:\nWorkspace Explorer\nView all parts and objects inside the Workspace.\nRemoteEvent Viewer\nCheck RemoteEvents and understand game communication.\nLocalScript Explorer\nSettings System\nTeleport Methods\nFast teleport\nTween teleport\nCustom Tween Speed\nProximityPrompt Tools\nBlink effect\nHold duration editor\nDelay customization\nInstant ProximityPrompt activation\nToggle Key System\nServer Hop Options\nHop to higher player count servers\nHop to lower player count servers\nUI Controls\nHotkey to hide/show the menu\nHome key support\nThanks for checking out my first project. More updates and improvements are coming soon. 🚀","tags":["Universal","DevTools","Script","roblox"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/2uaXkTNfmt","keyLink":"https://auth.platorelay.com/a?","owner":{"_id":"6a4e928ec365addbd1955669","username":"ItzKaizen","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"6a4e928ec365addbd1955669","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T21:49:40.883Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a58d6d0c7dc64e6d625dc5c","editBy":{"_id":"6a4e928ec365addbd1955669","username":"ItzKaizen","status":"offline","id":"6a4e928ec365addbd1955669"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-07-16T13:04:16.426Z"}],"comments":[]}